cov={'schemaVersion':1,'scope':'Own blind current requires-only20 ROUND-A description science/context review','selectorPin':{'path':str(sp),'sha256':sha(sp)},'frozenRoundAAndSharedPinsChecked':checks,'nativeCanonicalSEMViewQABindingsChecked':sourcechecks,'currentWholePProfilesEqualSuppliedWholeSourceProfiles':True,'nativeDEENRequiresApplicabilityAndImageBindingsMatch':True,'boundImagePinsChecked':imgs,'actualPDF':{'path':str(n/'bundle/book.pdf'),'sha256':sha(n/'bundle/book.pdf'),'physicalPages':22,'visuallyInspectedPhysicalGoalPages':list(range(3,23)),'frontMatter':'physical1/2 complete text and book/outline inspected','renderedContactSheets':[str(x) for x in sorted((out/'inspection').glob('bound-goal-pages-*.png'))]},'targetReadExtent':'All20 current bilingual titles/descriptions, complete canonicalContext including new requires, actual page prereq/successor paths, current target extendedData/provenance and all20 whole current P bodies: every bilingual expectation/coverage condition/variation/application brief/expected performance. Repeated passages were revisited where initial output truncated.','teacherContextRead':{'uniqueSuppliedPrerequisiteOrParentObjects':len(teachers),'goalIds':list(teachers),'extent':'All37 supplied unique bilingual direct-teacher descriptions/requires/contains, whole parent contexts and current439 page-role bindings. Orientation is not assumed to teach chemical facts.'},'sourceReadExtent':['BY official current C9 NTG LB4 orbital-overlap, molecule representations and EPA; LB5 product applications/interaction model. https://www.lehrplanplus.bayern.de/fachlehrplan/gymnasium/9/chemie/ch-ntg','BY current C12 basic LB1 matter cycles; LB5 qualitative relative reaction-enthalpy explanation versus separate calculation clause; LB8 work/primary cells and separate secondary-cell operator. https://www.lehrplanplus.bayern.de/fachlehrplan/gymnasium/12/chemie/grundlegend','BY current C13 basic polymer-feedstock evaluation clause. https://www.lehrplanplus.bayern.de/fachlehrplan/gymnasium/13/chemie/grundlegend','Original HE KC2024 physically35/36 E2/E4 acid/titration and separation/cracking;39 Q1.2 dipole/H-bond and LK coordinate Fehling;42 amino-acid/Biuret;43 polymer recycling;46/47 equilibrium/coexistence/curve LK and corrosion;48 neighboring buffer boundaries. HE24–28 general operators already read in this session.','Original BW physical19 printed17 EPA/source clause; RP physical57/58 mandatory LK coordinate binding versus elective advanced theories; NI original physical26 local cells/corrosion, separate actual experiments and eA coordination.','IUPAC primary Gold Book D01758: permanent dipole interaction and orientation dependence distinguish the explicitly named dipole-dipole part of target11. https://goldbook.iupac.org/terms/view/D01758','UCI original Investigating Iron Thiocyanate primary PDF physical1–3 and procedure/calibration context: Beer calibration, high-Fe near-complete conversion assumption and1:1 residual balances. https://cpb-us-e2.wpmucdn.com/faculty.sites.uci.edu/dist/a/326/files/2015/04/Chemical-Equilibrium.pdf'],'mappingReadExtent':'All20 source/provenance identities and context constraints; supplied direct mapping entries for11,12,15,18/19 and broader partner counts sampled deliberately. Thousands of repeated partial/cluster partner entries and all24 source PDFs were not read in full; no national whole-source approval or full mapping audit is claimed.','additionalPrimaryPins':extra,'additionalMaterialPins':[{'path':fp,'sha256':sha(fp)} for fp in extraMaterialPaths],'additionalMaterialReadExtent':['81373: Only wholeNamedChemicalMethod and wholeSyntheticRawChemicalFixture were read from selected supplied-material container; old goals/author/peer outcomes/memory decisions were not read. Checked original-state controls, residual upper-bound calibration, actual-vs-fixture distinction.','c21: Both exact fullLinkedPolymerCases for target c21 were read, including supplied data and bilingual rubrics; no old outcome fields read.','28c: Current P selects interpretation aspects of shared T05-C1/T05-C2/T08-C2 supplied tables. Those material/answer fields and POLY-QUALITATIVE-C1 whole supplied idealModelTable were read. Shared broader calculation tasks do not become current28c closure conditions.'],'historicalPFirstEmbedding':'9 historical missing embeddings were actually read as full present P bodies; no automatic P decision follows from that metadata.','limits':['No source/graph/text/P/image changes or new compiler/materialization/build.','No actual learner/laboratory performance or human approval observed.','No ROUND-B or old description-review decisions of these goals read.','The additional older material containers were accessed only for current scientific case data/method/rubric fields, not prior author/peer review decisions.'],'humanApprovalClaim':False}
